#### 0. System Constraints (Hard Enforcement)
*   **Scoring Anchor:** Baseline (Direct Gate Architecture) = 60 points. Target = 90 points (T₂* > 100 µs, Charge noise < 0.5 µeV/√Hz at 1 Hz).
